    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gothic Hell: Survivors</strong>  is top-down gothic chaos: 10\u201315 min survival runs with meta progression and loot management between. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for <strong>multiplayer</strong>, focused on <strong>single player</strong> at launch. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our Game Formula:</strong>\u00a0VS + PoE / D2 + Co-op</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE A SURVIVOR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/a1579229fb1e5891bf0a2a0f53e06a52.poster.avif?t=1754431245\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/a1579229fb1e5891bf0a2a0f53e06a52.webm?t=1754431245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/a1579229fb1e5891bf0a2a0f53e06a52.mp4?t=1754431245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Build your power, and dive into an atmospheric bullet hell experience that rewards creativity, adaptability, and momentum. No two runs play the same, and each one brings you closer to mastering the madness.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN POWERFUL SPELLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/53f4d4f338e69a54cdb1cfc89b78b5bc.poster.avif?t=1754431245\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/53f4d4f338e69a54cdb1cfc89b78b5bc.webm?t=1754431245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/53f4d4f338e69a54cdb1cfc89b78b5bc.mp4?t=1754431245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Master auto-cast spells and reactive movement while unlocking new powers, characters, and passive boosts. Explore layered 3D arenas with vertical challenges, hidden secrets, and dynamic events that make every battle feel fresh and alive.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/04940add4061a0ad6b27005753936271.poster.avif?t=1754431245\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/04940add4061a0ad6b27005753936271.webm?t=1754431245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/04940add4061a0ad6b27005753936271.mp4?t=1754431245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KILL BIG BOSS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/b7c0fa260f956cdf39bacf94ef9dcdb2.poster.avif?t=1754431245\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/b7c0fa260f956cdf39bacf94ef9dcdb2.webm?t=1754431245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/b7c0fa260f956cdf39bacf94ef9dcdb2.mp4?t=1754431245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...or DIE.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/12a09653194557c05cf730c1157467ab.avif?t=1754431245\" width=616 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced bullet hell ARPG with auto-cast spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Loot? A lot!</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Meta Progress? Yes!</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Unique survivors with game-changing abilities</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertical 3D arenas packed with secrets and shifting layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep synergy systems and meta progression between runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural encounters blended with handcrafted visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for high replayability and quick-hit sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gothic horror world with stylized art and haunting sound</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gothic Hell: Survivors</strong>  is top-down gothic chaos: 10\u201315 min survival runs with meta progression and loot management between. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for <strong>multiplayer</strong>, focused on <strong>single player</strong> at launch. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Our Game Formula:</strong>\u00a0VS + PoE / D2 + Co-op</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE A SURVIVOR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/a1579229fb1e5891bf0a2a0f53e06a52.poster.avif?t=1754431245\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/a1579229fb1e5891bf0a2a0f53e06a52.webm?t=1754431245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/a1579229fb1e5891bf0a2a0f53e06a52.mp4?t=1754431245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Build your power, and dive into an atmospheric bullet hell experience that rewards creativity, adaptability, and momentum. No two runs play the same, and each one brings you closer to mastering the madness.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN POWERFUL SPELLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/53f4d4f338e69a54cdb1cfc89b78b5bc.poster.avif?t=1754431245\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/53f4d4f338e69a54cdb1cfc89b78b5bc.webm?t=1754431245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/53f4d4f338e69a54cdb1cfc89b78b5bc.mp4?t=1754431245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Master auto-cast spells and reactive movement while unlocking new powers, characters, and passive boosts. Explore layered 3D arenas with vertical challenges, hidden secrets, and dynamic events that make every battle feel fresh and alive.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/04940add4061a0ad6b27005753936271.poster.avif?t=1754431245\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/04940add4061a0ad6b27005753936271.webm?t=1754431245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/04940add4061a0ad6b27005753936271.mp4?t=1754431245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KILL BIG BOSS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/b7c0fa260f956cdf39bacf94ef9dcdb2.poster.avif?t=1754431245\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/b7c0fa260f956cdf39bacf94ef9dcdb2.webm?t=1754431245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/b7c0fa260f956cdf39bacf94ef9dcdb2.mp4?t=1754431245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>...or DIE.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/12a09653194557c05cf730c1157467ab.avif?t=1754431245\" width=616 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced bullet hell ARPG with auto-cast spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Loot? A lot!</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Meta Progress? Yes!</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Unique survivors with game-changing abilities</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertical 3D arenas packed with secrets and shifting layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep synergy systems and meta progression between runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural encounters blended with handcrafted visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for high replayability and quick-hit sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gothic horror world with stylized art and haunting sound</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Face relentless hordes in a Gothic Bullet Hell ARPG with layered 3D arenas with secrets, objectives, evolving spell synergies, and deep progression. Choose your survivor, shape powerful builds, and conquer fast, intense runs packed with chaos and replayability. Our formula: VS + PoE / D2 + Co-op",
